    },
    {
      "id": "start_runtime",
      "acceptance": [
        "one declared restart after joint author verification and OS handback; new process/loaded server/addon match installed release and final manifest, canonical native hash matches package payload; identity/health are separate from actual media/quality/input/stop/reentry/client-device proof",
        "failure stops downstream delivery with explicit error and retained recovery evidence; only task-owned resources can be removed, existing shared legacy daemon-runtime is retained; static graph/operator build gate never substitutes actual install/restart acceptance"
